{"id":"prervat_","lemma":"прервать","pos":"verb","rank":3850,"glosses":["to abort, to cut short, to discontinue or suspend abruptly","to interrupt (a conversation, act, etc.)","to break off, to sever"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4e/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"прерву","2s":"прервёшь","3s":"прервёт","1p":"прервём","2p":"прервёте","3p":"прервут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"прерви","2p":"прервите"}}},"past":{"m":"прервал","p":"прервали","f":"прервала","n":"прервало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"прерывать","examples":[{"text":"Можно вас прервать ненадолго?","en":"May I interrupt you a while?","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},null,{"g":"for a short while"}]},{"text":"Почему она меня прервала?","en":"Why did she interrupt me?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Том меня прервал.","en":"Tom cut me off.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Том не хотел, чтобы его прервали.","en":"Tom didn't want to be interrupted.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"him / his"},null]},{"text":"Том прервал наш разговор.","en":"Tom interrupted our conversation.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"our, ours"},{"g":"talk, conversation"}]}]}